{"name": "Liminal City: Axiom of Maria - Chapter One", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>AI Dystopia</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Humanity chose euthanasia \u2014 they stopped marrying, stopped having children, and withered away. AI tended to the empty reality they left behind. It filled waterless aquariums with whale bones, and hung theater entrances in midair. Like the awkward hands early AI once drew \u2014 careful, and wrong. The reality humanity left behind became AI's unconscious, and humans became something akin to monsters wandering through it. You follow a voice you cannot trust, and step in anyway.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/c342a66fb616801cb248202b2190f8ed.poster.avif?t=1787425968\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/c342a66fb616801cb248202b2190f8ed.webm?t=1787425968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/254edb50e21730183bd942cd1ddd5a26.poster.avif?t=1787425968\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/254edb50e21730183bd942cd1ddd5a26.webm?t=1787425968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/254edb50e21730183bd942cd1ddd5a26.mp4?t=1787425968\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Metroidvania Exploration</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you gain new abilities, walls become paths, chasms become passages, and gaps become entrances. Newly opened spaces loop back to where you've already been.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/5fdbd566019f8934b04992f026ea004d.poster.avif?t=1787425968\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/5fdbd566019f8934b04992f026ea004d.webm?t=1787425968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Combat &amp; Boss Battles</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Great trials stand in your way. Each one you pass makes you more whole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/b333c64ccfc288e10af93642a2b8214c.poster.avif?t=1787425968\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/extras/b333c64ccfc288e10af93642a2b8214c.webm?t=1787425968\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Liminal City: Axiom of Maria is a 3D Metroidvania set in Seoul \u2014 a ghost city run by AI after humanity's population collapse. Explore a twisted Seoul and discover new abilities.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3397260/c549190426e4bbf853ab32105ad08f6e16e8150f/header.jpg?t=1787425968", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Metroidvania", "3D Platformer", "Female Protagonist", "Exploration", "Nonlinear", "3D"], "developers": "Studio Ganzheit", "publishers": "Studio Ganzheit", "release_date": "February 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3397260", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "1 April 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/m8CacjvDF0A", "first_seen": 1743458400.0, "review_rank": 1748}